WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.801
-We're about to play a game
called "What's Behind Me?"

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:04.934
My partner tonight
is the star of

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:07.167
"God's Favorite Idiot"
on Netflix

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:09.901
and host of HGTV's
"The Great Giveback."

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:13.133
Please give it up for the one
and only Melissa McCarthy!

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:14.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:16.701
Oh, yeah. Oh, come on.

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:19.334
-Hello!
-They love you.

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:21.667
Come on now.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:22.834
We love you.

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.567
So good to see you.
-It's good to see you too.

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:28.000
-Here's how the game works.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.868
Melissa and I will take turns
facing our backs to the curtain.

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.100
Behind the curtain
will be something

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.634
neither of us have seen before.

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.567
It could be people,
objects, anything.

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:38.067
Once the curtain opens up,
you have to pick up your card.

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.501
You have 45 seconds to try to
get the other person

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:42.200
to guess what's behind them.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.434
You can say anything you want
or use gestures.

00:00:44.434 --> 00:00:46.968
You just can't say any of
the words on your card.

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:49.267
Okay, Melissa, you will be
guessing first.

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:51.033
So let's get into position.
-Oh!

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:52.767
-Yeah.
-Oh, Jesus.

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:54.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:56.400
They don't tell you
about that part.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.834
-All of our budget went to this.

00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:00.267
Alright.

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:02.567
